/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:42:#   - Each generated board forces both outcomes: at least one sprite moves and at
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:43:#     least one sprite is blocked by a static decoy. This makes the collision-stop
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:45:#   - A blocked color is also used by a successful sprite, so the learner sees a
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:46:#     same-color singleton stay fixed while a larger same-color-marked sprite can
