/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:60:#     decoys, cancels the whole sprite move.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:61:#   - Pairwise target overlaps among translated sprites are also treated as
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:62:#     blocked for every involved sprite. The generator keeps successful targets
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:66:#   - The generator is still output-first. Successful sprites are placed solved in
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:68:#   - A blocked sprite is generated from a valid aligned target. One isolated
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:70:#     that target in both `out` and `inp`, and the blocked sprite itself is placed
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:73:#     task, so anchors, sprites, and decoys stay visually separated and legal.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:78:#       2) a larger multicolor sprite reacting to that color,
