/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:93:    - Interior foreground contains multicolor 8-connected sprites whose least frequent color is a marker, plus some isolated interior singleton decoys that share anchor colors but are not movable.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:94:    - Border anchors are isolated non-background border pixels; their edge position still determines whether matching sprites slide horizontally or vertically.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/10/code.py:97:    - Match each multicolor sprite to the border anchor with the same marker color, then compute the one-axis translation that aligns the marker with that anchor row or column.
